      "isDeleted": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Key: finoracle:v2:auth:session:{sid}\nid: UUID；user_id: UUID → users.id\nrefresh_jti: UUID\ncreated_at: integer (Unix 秒)\nexpires_at: integer (Unix 秒)\nrevoked: boolean，默认 false\nauth_version: integer，默认 0\n\nRedis 按 expires_at 自动过期。\n认证版本用于禁用后保持旧登录失效。",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "roughness": 1,
      "index": "b15",
      "updated": 1793534422174,
      "originalText": "Key: finoracle:v2:auth:session:{sid}\nid: UUID；user_id: UUID → users.id\nrefresh_jti: UUID\ncreated_at: integer (Unix 秒)\nexpires_at: integer (Unix 秒)\nrevoked: boolean，默认 false\nauth_version: integer，默认 0\n\nRedis 按 expires_at 自动过期。\n认证版本用于禁用后保持旧登录失效。",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
