      "opacity": 100,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "按 01 → 05 阅读；每段先从左向右发起请求，再按箭头返回。蓝色为 Access，紫色为 Refresh，红色为拒绝／撤销。",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
