      "isDeleted": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "签名载荷：sub=U, role=user, type=access, sid=S, jti=a1, iat, exp\n默认 30 分钟；只存前端内存。请求通过 Authorization: Bearer A1 传入。\njti 标识这枚令牌；普通请求校验 sid 会话，当前不比较 Access 的 jti。",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "roughness": 1,
      "index": "b1F",
      "updated": 1793535491487,
