      "isDeleted": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "签名载荷：sub=U, role=user, type=refresh, sid=S, jti=r1, iat, exp\n默认 7 天；存前端内存与当前标签页 sessionStorage，用 Body 提交续期。\nRedis 保存当前 refresh_jti=r1；轮换后变 r2，用来识别旧 Refresh 重放。",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "roughness": 1,
      "index": "b1I",
      "updated": 1793535491487,
      "originalText": "签名载荷：sub=U, role=user, type=refresh, sid=S, jti=r1, iat, exp\n默认 7 天；存前端内存与当前标签页 sessionStorage，用 Body 提交续期。\nRedis 保存当前 refresh_jti=r1；轮换后变 r2，用来识别旧 Refresh 重放。",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
