      "seed": 699579675,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 774355355,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "{access_token:A1, refresh_token:R1,\n token_type:\"bearer\", expires_in, user}\nexpires_in = A1.exp - A1.iat，单位秒。\nRedis 写入与 MySQL 提交成功后才返回。\n失败返回 503；必要时撤销新会话进行补偿。",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "roughness": 1,
      "index": "b2B",
      "updated": 1793535491488,
      "originalText": "{access_token:A1, refresh_token:R1,\n token_type:\"bearer\", expires_in, user}\nexpires_in = A1.exp - A1.iat，单位秒。\nRedis 写入与 MySQL 提交成功后才返回。\n失败返回 503；必要时撤销新会话进行补偿。",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
