      "opacity": 100,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "读取 Redis finoracle:v2:auth:session:S。\n会话必须存在、未过期且 revoked=false。\nrecord.user_id 必须等于 claims.sub。\n每次受保护请求都检查服务端会话状态。",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "roughness": 1,
      "index": "b2f",
      "updated": 1793535491488,
      "originalText": "读取 Redis finoracle:v2:auth:session:S。\n会话必须存在、未过期且 revoked=false。\nrecord.user_id 必须等于 claims.sub。\n每次受保护请求都检查服务端会话状态。",
