    {
      "id": "73f1000761964e8a9bbfbd0f7a626fac",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1738,
      "y": 2818,
      "width": 533.4599999999999,
      "height": 106.25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "groupIds": [
        "4373dd8726d549529bcd8622569b5839"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "seed": 394955419,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 676089556,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "AuthProvider 每 20 秒检查，剩余 ≤60 秒时续期。\n刷新页面：从 sessionStorage 恢复 R1。\n首次 getProfile 没有 Access，先调用 refresh。\n受保护请求遇 401 时，最多续期并重试一次。\nPOST /api/v1/auth/refresh，Body: {refresh_token:R1}",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "roughness": 1,
      "index": "b3E",
      "updated": 1793535491489,
      "originalText": "AuthProvider 每 20 秒检查，剩余 ≤60 秒时续期。\n刷新页面：从 sessionStorage 恢复 R1。\n首次 getProfile 没有 Access，先调用 refresh。\n受保护请求遇 401 时，最多续期并重试一次。\nPOST /api/v1/auth/refresh，Body: {refresh_token:R1}",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
