      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 375727810,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "SessionStore.get(S) + UserRepository.get_by_id(U)\n会话未过期、未撤销，record.user_id=U。\n用户 status=active；认证版本与 Redis 一致。\n验证通过后，才准备新的双令牌。",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "roughness": 1,
      "index": "b3K",
      "updated": 1793535491489,
      "originalText": "SessionStore.get(S) + UserRepository.get_by_id(U)\n会话未过期、未撤销，record.user_id=U。\n用户 status=active；认证版本与 Redis 一致。\n验证通过后，才准备新的双令牌。",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
